{"root":"pli/ms","translators":["sujato"],"title":"Devasabha (2nd)","html":"<article id='thag1.100'><header><ul><li class='division'><span class='root'>Theragāthā 1.100 </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Verses of the Senior Monks 1.100 </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Ekakanipāta </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>The Book of the Ones </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Dasamavagga </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Chapter Ten </span></li></ul>\n<h1 class='sutta-title'><span class='root'>(Dutiya) Devasabhattheragāthā </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Devasabha (2nd) </span></h1></header>\n<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>“Sammappadhānasampanno, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Accomplished in the four right efforts, </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Satipaṭṭhānagocaro; </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>mindfulness meditation is your range; </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Vimuttikusumasañchanno, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>festooned with the flowers of liberation, </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Parinibbissatyanāsavo”ti. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>undefiled, you’ll be fully quenched. </span></span></p></blockquote>\n<p class='endsutta'><span class='root'>… Devasabho thero …. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></p>\n<p class='endvagga'><span class='root'>vaggo dasamo. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></p>\n<p class='uddana-intro'><span class='root'>Tassuddānaṁ </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></p>\n<blockquote class='uddanagatha'><p><span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Paripuṇṇako ca vijayo, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>erako mettajī muni; </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Cakkhupālo khaṇḍasumano, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>tisso ca abhayo tathā; </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Uttiyo ca mahāpañño, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>thero devasabhopi cāti. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></span></p></blockquote></article>"}
